---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us | AITrader EA">
  <div class="container max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 prose prose-invert prose-primary">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>Welcome to AITrader EA. We are a dedicated team of independent researchers, testers, and analysts.</p>
    <p>Our mission is to provide transparent, unbiased, and data-driven reviews to help you make the best decisions. Every product we review undergoes rigorous backtesting and live evaluation.</p>
    <h2>How We Review</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Objectivity:</strong> We do not accept paid placements for higher scores.</li>
      <li><strong>Data-Driven:</strong> Our verdicts are based on actual performance metrics, pricing, and user feedback.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate Disclosure:</strong> To keep our site free, we may earn a commission if you purchase through our links. This does not impact our editorial independence.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For business inquiries, please contact us at admin@aitraderea.com.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>